---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About The AI Duet and Ellen — field notes from the intersection of Chinese AI and global markets, based in Singapore.">
  <section class="page">
    <div class="page-inner">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>The AI Duet</strong> is a content platform at the intersection of Chinese AI
          and global markets.
        </p>

        <p>
          It started with a simple observation: Singapore is where Chinese AI founders land
          first when going global — and increasingly, where American AI companies enter Asia.
          Both sides are curious about each other. Both need to understand how the other
          ecosystem works. But there's no good English-language source for the Chinese side
          of this story.
        </p>

        <p>
          The AI Duet fills that gap. The content comes from real conversations with founders
          on the ground — their strategies, their mistakes, their firsthand experience
          navigating between worlds.
        </p>

        <h2>About Ellen</h2>

        <p>
          I focus on AI entrepreneurship and going global. I cold-started a global Chinese
          social app, and now I work with AI entrepreneurs who have global vision and markets.
        </p>

        <p>
          I produce <strong>离线时间</strong>, a Chinese-language podcast where I sit down with
          Chinese AI founders in Singapore and dig into their frontline experience — how they
          build, how they think about markets, and what they've learned the hard way. The AI
          Duet is the English window into those conversations and the broader ecosystem I
          observe every day.
        </p>

        <p>
          Beyond content, I offer two services for AI entrepreneurs with global ambitions:
          <a href="/services">fundraising advisory</a> and landing events with growth consulting.
        </p>

        <h2>离线时间 — The Chinese Podcast</h2>

        <p>
          The AI Duet originates from 离线时间, a weekly Chinese-language podcast featuring
          in-depth conversations with AI founders building globally from Singapore.
          Find it on:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="channels">
        <a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69c0a6b7d3dbdb2f6aad35cb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🎙</div>
          <div class="channel-info">
            <h3>小宇宙 Xiaoyuzhou</h3>
            <p>Primary podcast home</p>
          </div>
          <span class="channel-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/sg/podcast/%E7%A6%BB%E7%BA%BF%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4/id1886676611" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🍎</div>
          <div class="channel-info">
            <h3>Apple Podcasts</h3>
            <p>Subscribe on Apple</p>
          </div>
          <span class="channel-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/5ioH28qEbvMZYWD77rcKnL" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">🎧</div>
          <div class="channel-info">
            <h3>Spotify</h3>
            <p>Listen on Spotify</p>
          </div>
          <span class="channel-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/56a57315e4251d3524570a58" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="channel-card">
          <div class="channel-icon">📕</div>
          <div class="channel-info">
            <h3>小红书 Xiaohongshu</h3>
            <p>Bite-sized insights and updates</p>
          </div>
          <span class="channel-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" style="margin-top: 48px;">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>

        <p>
          I'm always interested in connecting with founders, investors, and anyone curious
          about the Chinese AI ecosystem. Reach me at
          <a href="mailto:ellen@theaiduet.com">ellen@theaiduet.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { padding: 80px var(--spacing-page); }
  .page-inner { max-width: var(--prose-width); margin: 0 auto; }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .prose { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .prose :global(p) { margin-bottom: 24px; color: #1e293b; }
  .prose :global(h2) {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .prose :global(a) { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .prose :global(strong) { font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text); }

  .channels { margin-top: 24px; }
  .channel-card {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
    padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .channel-card:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .channel-card:hover { opacity: 1; }
  .channel-card:hover .channel-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); color: var(--color-accent); }
  .channel-icon { font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; width: 32px; text-align: center; }
  .channel-info { flex: 1; }
  .channel-info h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .channel-info p { margin-top: 2px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .channel-arrow {
    font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page { padding: 48px 20px; }
    .page-title { font-size: 32px; }
  }
</style>
